name: Whimsy Dicetricks
author: for pi — Perkeo + Hieroglyph + Showman + Negative skip-tag + stacked Oops/copy core + lucky ladder
description: >
  Perkeo from early packs; Hieroglyph voucher ante 1; Showman early (antes 1-3)
  so the Oops can stack; Negative small-blind Tag ante 4; Oops! All 6s in the
  ante-4 shop (slots 2-4) as a must. Should: stacked Oops at antes 4 and 5, the
  copy/retrigger core, and the lucky hit-stream ladders (money + mult, 8 to 1).
  Anaglyph so every skip tag doubles.
deck: Anaglyph
stake: White

must:
  - legendaryJoker: Perkeo
    antes: [2]
  - smallBlindTag: NegativeTag
    antes: [2,3,4,5,6,7,8]
    min: 2
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [2,3,4,5,6,7,8]
    sources:
      shopItems: [2,3,4,5,6,7,8]

  - joker: Showman
    antes: [1,2,3,4]
should:
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [5]
    sources:
      shopItems: [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]
    score: 100
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [3]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0]
    score: 100
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [6]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0,1,2]
    score: 100
  - luckyMoney: [0]
    score: 28
  - luckyMoney: [1]
    score: 27
  - luckyMoney: [2]
    score: 26
  - luckyMoney: [3]
    score: 25
  - luckyMoney: [4]
    score: 24
  - luckyMoney: [5]
    score: 23
  - luckyMoney: [6]
    score: 22
  - luckyMoney: [7]
    score: 21
  - luckyMult: [0]
    score: 8
  - luckyMult: [1]
    score: 7
  - luckyMult: [2]
    score: 6
  - luckyMult: [3]
    score: 5
  - luckyMult: [4]
    score: 4
  - luckyMult: [5]
    score: 3
  - luckyMult: [6]
    score: 2
  - luckyMult: [7]
    score: 1

